    "detailed_description": "<h1>ALSO RECOMMENDED FOR YOU</h1><p><br></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2104860/extras/dd9124abe6bf6bd35dcf2aaae8e252b0.poster.avif?t=1697316347\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2104860/extras/dd9124abe6bf6bd35dcf2aaae8e252b0.webm?t=1697316347\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2104860/extras/dd9124abe6bf6bd35dcf2aaae8e252b0.mp4?t=1697316347\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>In Surprise Cat, a 3D puzzle game, you will have to collect resources, find hidden objects, and manipulate them to eliminate your enemies and progress, dive into the paws-itively one-of-a-kind world of Surprise Cat today!<br><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">FEATURING</h2></strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Clear and intuitive gameplay mechanics<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2104860/extras/a52c95f89e082c255777401a7515ddcf.poster.avif?t=1697316347\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2104860/extras/a52c95f89e082c255777401a7515ddcf.webm?t=1697316347\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2104860/extras/a52c95f89e082c255777401a7515ddcf.mp4?t=1697316347\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br></li><li> Collect resources<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2104860/extras/a97d2ecfff4bc70a14fd055f3af839d8.poster.avif?t=1697316347\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/21